  "details": "Ability to draw a box around a set of nodes, label it, and add a custom color. Any nodes inside it's bounds, will move along the box when it is dragged. This also avoids needing to ctrl + click multiple nodes before moving them. This serves a dual purpose of allowing better management of complex node groups, while also allowing rich comments and self documentation.",
